    "Scan of the 1986 edition of the Pe Ell, Washington, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1983; field checked in 1984; photo revised in 1993; last revised in 1986; printed in 1994.",
    "Release: Provisional. Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22.1 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
